def _entity_precision_score(entity:Mapping[str,Any],text:str,role:str)->float:
    """Calibrate extraction confidence without an external NER model.

    The score starts from the extractor's evidence strength and then uses only
    local structural evidence: extraction method, lexical specificity, role,
    and whether the sentence actually carries problem/diagnostic/remediation
    signal. Generic nouns are deliberately penalized because they inflated the
    v5.2 entity counts without adding much analytical value.
    """
