def signature_purity(signatures,labels):
    """Cluster purity over structure-aware signature tokens.

    For each cluster, build a core signature from tokens present in at least
    30% of its assigned documents and average Jaccard agreement with that core.
    This favors clusters that are not merely lexically close, but also share
    service/device/context structure.
